From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rumisle <why-excuse-quail@duck.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 12:12:12 +0800
Subject: app: offer a reload when a new version is installed

A new build waits until every page of the old one closes, and an app
installed on the iOS home screen is suspended rather than closed, so it
kept running the old build. Check for a new one whenever the app comes
back (at most once a minute), and once it is installed show "A new
version is ready" with Reload, which hands over to it and reloads every
page of the old build.

Ocelot-Patch: web/app-update

